    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mason Estates are delighted to present No. 172 Mulvey Park to the market, a superb three-bedroom end-of-terrace home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential enclave. Benefiting from side access and a detached garage, this property offers additional practicality and potential, and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout, having been extended, upgraded and well maintained by its current owners.\n\nA standout feature is the impressive rear extension, which greatly enhances the ground floor living space. The property further benefits from a private rear garden extending to approximately 20m / 65ft, incorporating a sunroom and screened rear porch, ideal for year-round use. To the front, there is a generous garden with clear potential to provide driveway parking.\n\nExtending to approximately 100sq.m., the well-proportioned accommodation comprises a porch entrance leading to a welcoming hallway, a comfortable living room to the front, and a versatile office/dining room. To the rear, the extended kitchen area connects through to an internal hallway, shower room, sunroom, and rear porch, creating a flexible and functional living space. Upstairs, there are three bedrooms (two doubles and one single), with the main bedroom benefiting from a modern en-suite.\n\nOverlooking a green and set in a quiet, established development, the location is second to none. Windy Arbour LUAS stop is within a short stroll, providing swift access to the city centre (approximately 10 minutes to St. Stephen`s Green). A range of local amenities are close at hand including shops in Clonskeagh, Dundrum Town Centre, UCD, and an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, making this a highly convenient and desirable place to live.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\nTotal Floor Area: 100 sq.m (1,076 sq.ft.) Approx. \n\nENTRANCE HALL:\nWith laminate wooden flooring and door to\n\nLIVING ROOM: 5.00m (max) x 3.89m\nBright living-room with feature fireplace and laminate wood flooring and double doors to..\n\nOFFICE/DINING-ROOM: 2.46m (max) x 4.74m\nExcellently proportioned room with a large window and laminate wood flooring.\n\nKITCHEN: 4.84m (max) x 3.51m\nWith tiled floor and slpashback, Velux window for natural light, fitted wall and floor units, dishwasher, stainless steel sink.\n\nSHOWER-ROOM: 1.94m x 1.78m\nWith natural light, fully tiled with walk-in shower/shower screen, wc., whb. with storage and vanity unit.\n\nSUNROOM: 2.19m x 3.51m\nWith wood flooring and access to the rear garden.\n\nFIRST FLOOR:\nBEDROOM 1: 3.46m x 3.89m\nDouble bedroom located to the front with built-in wardrobes and laminate wood flooring. \n\nENSUITE: 1.52m x 1.43m\nFully tiled with walk-in shower/shower screen, wc., whb. with storage and vanity unit.\n\nBEDROOM 2: 3.30m x 2.50m\nDouble bedroom located to the rear with built-in wardrobes and laminate wood flooring. \n\nBEDROOM 3: 2.41m x 2.14m\nSingle bedroom located to the rear.\n\nGARAGE: 6m x 3m\nDetached garage with electricity.\n\nGARDENS:\nLow maintenance front garden with potential for off-street parking. Lovely private well planted rear garden measuring c. 18m/59ft., with 2 paved patio areas and a greenhouse. \n\nGENERAL POINTS: SERVICES: UTILITIES\nBER is D2 and the number is 119205177\nGas fired central heating\nDetached garage\n"
      },
